{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日EA官方公佈大規模內部重組計劃，BioWare(生軟)正式關閉，處於早期開發階段的全新《質量效應》項目直接取消。同時砍掉代號「蓮花(Project Lotus)」的《模擬人生》新作，全公司裁員約400人，佔總員工數3%，其中約50人來自BioWare埃德蒙頓工作室。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583278.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.035705+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:26:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"398448163164c5b45ff020d8b1ab78d28cbd2e42c2be7c618c7c667c65225ac2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}